{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":8,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Then Jehovah said to me, Take a large tablet and write on it in plain letters, For Maher-shalal-hash-baz;","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to me, "},{"t":"Take","s":["H3947"],"a":[3]},{"t":" a large tablet and "},{"t":"write","s":["H3789"],"a":[7]},{"t":" on it in plain letters, For "},{"t":"Maher","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"shalal","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"hash","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"baz","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":2,"text":"And I will take faithful witnesses, Urijah the priest and Zechariah the son of Jeberechiah.","tok":[{"t":"And I will take "},{"t":"faithful","s":["H0539"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"witnesses","s":["H5707"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Urijah the "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Zechariah","s":["H2148"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jeberechiah","s":["H3000"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And I went to the prophetess, and she conceived and bore a son. And Jehovah said to me, Call his name Maher-shalal-hash-baz,","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"went","s":["H7126"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"prophetess","s":["H5031"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and she "},{"t":"conceived","s":["H2029"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"bore","s":["H3205"],"a":[4]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[5]},{"t":". And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"me","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Call","s":["H7121"],"a":[9]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Maher","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"shalal","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"hash","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"baz","s":["H4122"],"a":[11]},{"t":","}]},{"n":4,"text":"For before this boy knows how to call, Father, and, Mother, they will carry off the wealth of Damascus and the spoil of Samaria before the king of Assyria.","tok":[{"t":"For before this boy knows how to call, "},{"t":"Father","s":["H0001"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and, "},{"t":"Mother","s":["H0517"],"a":[6]},{"t":", they will carry off the wealth of "},{"t":"Damascus","s":["H1834"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"spoil","s":["H7998"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Samaria","s":["H8111"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[14]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Assyria","s":["H0804"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Then Jehovah spoke further to me, saying,","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H1696"],"a":[2]},{"t":" further to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":","}]},{"n":6,"text":"Because these people have rejected The gently flowing waters of Shiloah, and exult In Rezin and the son of Remaliah,","tok":[{"t":"Because these "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":" have rejected The gently flowing "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Shiloah","s":["H7975"],"a":[7]},{"t":", and exult In "},{"t":"Rezin","s":["H7526"],"a":[12]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of Remaliah,"}]},{"n":7,"text":"Now therefore the Lord is bringing up upon them The mighty and abundant waters of the Euphrates, The king of Assyria and all his glory; And it will overflow all its channels, And go over all its banks.","tok":[{"t":"Now therefore the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is bringing "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[3]},{"t":" upon them The mighty and abundant "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of the Euphrates, The "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Assyria","s":["H0804"],"a":[12]},{"t":" and all his "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[15]},{"t":"; And it will overflow all its "},{"t":"channels","s":["H0650"],"a":[19]},{"t":", And go "},{"t":"over","s":["H1980"],"a":[20]},{"t":" all its "},{"t":"banks","s":["H1415"],"a":[23]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"It will sweep through Judah; it will overflow and rise Until it reaches the neck; And the spreading out of its wings Will fill the breadth of Your land, O Immanuel.","tok":[{"t":"It will sweep through "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; it will "},{"t":"overflow","s":["H7857"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and rise Until it "},{"t":"reaches","s":["H5060"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"neck","s":["H6677"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; And the spreading "},{"t":"out","s":["H4298"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of its "},{"t":"wings","s":["H3671"],"a":[9]},{"t":" Will "},{"t":"fill","s":["H4393"],"a":[10]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"breadth","s":["H7341"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Immanuel","s":["H6005"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Be broken, O peoples, and be shattered; Hearken, all you distant places of the earth: Gird yourselves, yet be shattered; Gird yourselves, yet be shattered.","tok":[{"t":"Be broken, O "},{"t":"peoples","s":["H5971"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and be shattered; Hearken, "},{"t":"all","s":["H3605"],"a":[4]},{"t":" you distant places of the earth: "},{"t":"Gird","s":["H0247"],"a":[7]},{"t":" yourselves, yet be shattered; "},{"t":"Gird","s":["H0247"],"a":[9]},{"t":" yourselves, yet be shattered."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Take counsel, yet it will be frustrated; Speak the word, yet it will not stand; For God is with us.","tok":[{"t":"Take","s":["H5779"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"counsel","s":["H6098"],"a":[1]},{"t":", yet it will be frustrated; "},{"t":"Speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[4]},{"t":", yet it will not "},{"t":"stand","s":["H6965"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; For "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[9]},{"t":" is with us."}]},{"n":11,"text":"For Jehovah spoke to me in this way with great force and instructed me not to walk in the way of this people, saying,","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to me in this way with great force and "},{"t":"instructed","s":["H3256"],"a":[7]},{"t":" me not to "},{"t":"walk","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of this "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[10]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[12]},{"t":","}]},{"n":12,"text":"You shall not call it conspiracy All that this people calls conspiracy; And you shall not fear what they fear nor hold it in awe.","tok":[{"t":"You shall not call it conspiracy All that this "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[6]},{"t":" calls conspiracy; And you shall not "},{"t":"fear","s":["H4172"],"a":[10]},{"t":" what they "},{"t":"fear","s":["H3372"],"a":[12]},{"t":" nor hold it in awe."}]},{"n":13,"text":"You shall sanctify Jehovah of hosts; He shall be the One to fear and He shall be the One to hold in awe.","tok":[{"t":"You shall "},{"t":"sanctify","s":["H6942"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; He shall be the One to "},{"t":"fear","s":["H4172"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and He shall be the One to hold in awe."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Then He will become a sanctuary, yet a stone to strike against And a rock of stumbling To both houses of Israel, A trap and a snare to the inhabitants of Jerusalem.","tok":[{"t":"Then He will become a "},{"t":"sanctuary","s":["H4720"],"a":[1]},{"t":", yet a "},{"t":"stone","s":["H0068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to strike against And a "},{"t":"rock","s":["H6697"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"stumbling","s":["H5063"],"a":[3]},{"t":" To "},{"t":"both","s":["H8147"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"houses","s":["H1004"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[8]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"trap","s":["H6341"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and a "},{"t":"snare","s":["H4170"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"inhabitants","s":["H3427"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"And many will stumble at these, And will fall and be broken to pieces, And will be snared and taken captive.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"stumble","s":["H3782"],"a":[0]},{"t":" at these, And will "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and be "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to pieces, And will be "},{"t":"snared","s":["H3369"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"taken","s":["H3920"],"a":[6]},{"t":" captive."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Bind up the testimony; seal the instruction among my disciples;","tok":[{"t":"Bind "},{"t":"up","s":["H6887"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"testimony","s":["H8584"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"seal","s":["H2856"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the instruction among my "},{"t":"disciples","s":["H3928"],"a":[4]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":17,"text":"And I will wait on Jehovah, who hides His face from the house of Jacob, and I will look eagerly for Him.","tok":[{"t":"And I will "},{"t":"wait","s":["H2442"],"a":[0]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"hides","s":["H5641"],"a":[2]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jacob","s":["H3290"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and I will "},{"t":"look","s":["H6960"],"a":[6]},{"t":" eagerly for Him."}]},{"n":18,"text":"See, I and the children whom Jehovah has given me are for signs and wonders in Israel from Jehovah of hosts, who abides on Mount Zion.","tok":[{"t":"See, I and the "},{"t":"children","s":["H3206"],"a":[2]},{"t":" whom "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"given","s":["H5414"],"a":[4]},{"t":" me are for "},{"t":"signs","s":["H0226"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"wonders","s":["H4159"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[9]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[12]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"abides","s":["H7931"],"a":[13]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"Mount","s":["H2022"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"When they say to you, Inquire of the necromancers and the familiar spirits, who twitter and mutter; say to them, Should not a people inquire of their God? Should they go to the dead on behalf of the living —","tok":[{"t":"When they "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to you, Inquire of the necromancers and the familiar "},{"t":"spirits","s":["H0178"],"a":[5]},{"t":", who twitter and "},{"t":"mutter","s":["H1897"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; say to them, Should not a "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[11]},{"t":" inquire of their "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[13]},{"t":"? Should they go to the "},{"t":"dead","s":["H4191"],"a":[18]},{"t":" on behalf of the "},{"t":"living","s":["H2416"],"a":[16]},{"t":" —"}]},{"n":20,"text":"To the law and to the testimony! If they do not speak according to this word, it is because in them there is no dawn.","tok":[{"t":"To the "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and to the "},{"t":"testimony","s":["H8584"],"a":[1]},{"t":"! If they do not "},{"t":"speak","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":" according to this "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[5]},{"t":", it is because in them there is no dawn."}]},{"n":21,"text":"And they go through it hard-pressed and hungry; and when they are hungry, they rage and curse their king and their God. They turn their faces upward,","tok":[{"t":"And they go through it hard-pressed and "},{"t":"hungry","s":["H7457"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; and when they are "},{"t":"hungry","s":["H7456"],"a":[6]},{"t":", they rage and "},{"t":"curse","s":["H7043"],"a":[8]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and their "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[10]},{"t":". They turn their faces "},{"t":"upward","s":["H4605"],"a":[12]},{"t":","}]},{"n":22,"text":"And they look to the earth, but there is only distress and darkness, the gloom of anguish and being thrust into darkness.","tok":[{"t":"And they "},{"t":"look","s":["H5027"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[1]},{"t":", but there is only distress and "},{"t":"darkness","s":["H2825"],"a":[5]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"gloom","s":["H4588"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"anguish","s":["H6695"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and being thrust into "},{"t":"darkness","s":["H0653"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]}]}
